* Task 5 fixture: MERGE statement (SQL DML) — write edge to a DDM.
* MERGE targets a DDM table; internals are not modeled.

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #PERS-ID (N8)
  1 #NAME (A20)
END-DEFINE

MERGE INTO EMPLOYEES
  USING #PERS-ID
  WHEN MATCHED THEN UPDATE SET NAME = #NAME
  WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN INSERT (NAME) VALUES (#NAME)

END
